msgid "**Admin Accounts from the Administrator Group:** ```files/php/rbac/reconcile_admin_users.php`` <./files/php/rbac/reconcile_admin_users.php>`__ activates the Magento admin accounts of the ``administrator`` group members and deactivates every other admin account; the platform administrator stays untouched. ```tasks/04_rbac.yml`` <./tasks/04_rbac.yml>`__ registers it as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__, which runs it in the PHP container at every deploy and on its timer."
