msgid "**Identity header bound to the front proxy:** the vhost sends the ``sso_proxy_secret`` credential as ``X-Infinito-Sso-Proxy`` with every request, and a ``server-begin`` fragment mounted into the image’s nginx (``templates/sso_proxy.conf.j2``) answers 403 to every request that carries ``X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`` without that secret. A client that reaches the container port, the oauth2-proxy port or the role network directly can no longer sign in as another user. ``files/test/test.sh`` asserts the refusal inside the container on every CLI test run."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Identity header bound to the front proxy:** the vhost sends the `sso_proxy_secret` credential as `X-Infinito-Sso-Proxy` with every request, and a `server-begin` fragment mounted into the image's nginx (`templates/sso_proxy.conf.j2`) answers 403 to every request that carries `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` without that secret. A client that reaches the container port, the oauth2-proxy port or the role network directly can no longer sign in as another user. `files/test/test.sh` asserts the refusal inside the container on every CLI test run."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Identity mapping:** `GENERIC_USER_ID_ATTRIBUTE`, `GENERIC_USER_EMAIL_ATTRIBUTE`, `GENERIC_USER_DISPLAY_NAME_ATTRIBUTE`, `GENERIC_USER_FIRST_NAME_ATTRIBUTE` and `GENERIC_USER_LAST_NAME_ATTRIBUTE` name the OIDC username, email, name, given name and family name claims, so the LiteLLM user id is the Keycloak username that `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` matches. LiteLLM reads no role from the claims and keeps the role it stored at the first sign-in, so [files/python/rbac_reconcile.py](./files/python/rbac_reconcile.py) runs as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer: members of the administrator role group become `proxy_admin`, every other `proxy_admin` falls back to `internal_user`, and the platform administrator and `default_user_id` keep their role."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Identity mapping:** ``GENERIC_USER_ID_ATTRIBUTE``, ``GENERIC_USER_EMAIL_ATTRIBUTE``, ``GENERIC_USER_DISPLAY_NAME_ATTRIBUTE``, ``GENERIC_USER_FIRST_NAME_ATTRIBUTE`` and ``GENERIC_USER_LAST_NAME_ATTRIBUTE`` name the OIDC username, email, name, given name and family name claims, so the LiteLLM user id is the Keycloak username that ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` matches. LiteLLM reads no role from the claims and keeps the role it stored at the first sign-in, so `files/python/rbac_reconcile.py <./files/python/rbac_reconcile.py>`__ runs as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer: members of the administrator role group become ``proxy_admin``, every other ``proxy_admin`` falls back to ``internal_user``, and the platform administrator and ``default_user_id`` keep their role."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** A compromised `Makefile` could chain multiple non-blocked destructive calls. The mitigation is the normal code-review process for pull requests."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** تنازل `Makefile` يمكن أن يقيد عدة مكالمات تدميرية غير مقفلة The mitigation is the normal code-review process for withdrawal requests."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** A credential directory not listed in `denyRead` (for example `~/.azure`, `~/.doctl`, `~/.config/op`) is readable by the agent, and its contents can leak into the transcript. Contributors adding a new credential store MUST extend `denyRead` in the same commit."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** دليل إبداعي غير مدرج في القائمة `denyRead` (على سبيل المثال `~/.azure`.. `~/.doctl`.. `~/.config/op`) قابل للقراءة من قبل الوكيل ومحتوياته يمكن أن تتسرب إلى النص مساهمون يضيفون متجرا جديدا للإبداع `denyRead` في نفس الخط"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** An invocation of `docker exec <container> docker run --privileged -v /:/host ...` escapes the sandbox without triggering the ask-gate. There is no automated mitigation for this path. Protection relies on the shell-loop deny rule, the `sudo*` deny rule, and operator review of any command that contains nested `docker`."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** احتجاج `docker exec <container> docker run --privileged -v /:/host ...` يهرب من صندوق الرمل بدون أن يحفز البوابة ولا يوجد تخفيف آلي لهذا الطريق. الحماية تعتمد على قاعدة الإنكار `sudo*` إنكار الحكم، واستعراض المشغل لأي أمر يحتوي على معلومات `docker`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** Blind-approving `ask` prompts defeats the policy layer entirely. Operators MUST treat every `ask` prompt as a code-review checkpoint."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** Blind-approving `ask` يدفع إلى هزيمة طبقة السياسة بالكامل المشغلون يعاملون كل `ask` بسرعة كنقطة تفتيش"

# المساهمون يركّزون صندوق الرمل بدلاً من إضعاف هذه الأعلام انظر قسم الغلال في
# [sandbox.md](sandbox.md).
msgid "**If violated:** Every Bash command runs unconfined on the host. Contributors MUST install the sandbox backend rather than weaken these flags. See the installer section in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** If a contributor widens `allowWrite` (for example by adding `~/` or `/`), the broad allow rules become genuinely broad. Changes to `allowWrite` SHOULD be reviewed with the same scrutiny as a `deny` rule."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** إذا اتسع المساهم `allowWrite` (على سبيل المثال عن طريق إضافة `~/` أو `/`), فالقواعد العامة تسمح بأن تصبح واسعة بشكل حقيقي. التغييرات إلى `allowWrite` يجب أن يُعاد النظر فيه بنفس التدقيق `deny` القاعدة"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** Running Claude Code on a host with production containers exposes those containers to disruption. A contributor on such a host SHOULD add read-only-narrowing `docker *` ask/deny entries in `.claude/settings.local.json` before starting a session."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** تشغيل Claude Code على مضيف مع حاويات الإنتاج تعرض تلك الحاويات للتعطيل مساهم على هذا المضيف يجب أن يضيف فقط `docker *` دخول الطلب/العدوى `.claude/settings.local.json` قبل بدء الدورة."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** The attempt fails, the agent sees the error, and typically refactors within one retry. No host-level exposure."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** المحاولة تفشل، يرى العميل الخطأ، وعادة ما يُعيد التشهير في عملية واحدة. لا يوجد تعرض على مستوى المضيف"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**If violated:** This is the baseline cost of allowing Docker at all. Contributors on hosts where this cost is unacceptable SHOULD disable Docker socket access locally by denying `/var/run/docker.sock` in `.claude/settings.local.json`, accepting that `docker` commands will stop working."
msgstr "**إذا انتهك:** هذه هي التكلفة الأساسية للسماح لدوكر على الإطلاق. المساهمون في المستضيفين حيث تكون هذه التكلفة غير مقبولة `/var/run/docker.sock` في `.claude/settings.local.json`, تقبل ذلك `docker` الأوامر ستتوقف عن العمل"

msgid "**If violated:** Without a running SSH agent, SSH fetches inside the sandbox fail with `Permission denied (publickey)`; load the key into an agent or fetch over HTTPS. A contributor whose key uses a non-default file name MUST add that path to `denyRead` in `.claude/settings.local.json`."
msgstr ""

