msgid "**Role mapping:** Members of the ``administrator`` role group join ``XWiki.XWikiAdminGroup`` at every OIDC login and leave it when the membership is gone (``oidc.groups.mapping``); under LDAP the same group is mapped by its DN ``cn=web-app-xwiki-administrator`` in the roles OU."
