msgid "**Role reconcile:** With SSO, `files/python/reconcile_oauth2_roles.py <./files/python/reconcile_oauth2_roles.py>`__ gives each ``administrator`` group member an OAuth2 account with the Administrator role and sets every other OAuth2 account to User. It runs as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer. The internal default administrator stays untouched."
