msgid "**Secret path:** The client secret reaches the container base64-encoded on the task’s stdin and travels on as an environment variable named by ``container exec -e``, so it is never on an argv. Proxmox VE stores it as ``client-key`` in ``/etc/pve/domains.cfg``, where its own ``pveum realm add`` keeps it."
