msgid "**Service Locking:** Delays maintenance tasks while critical services run. A unit counts as running while systemd reports its ActiveState as `activating`, `active`, `reloading` or `deactivating`, except in the sub-states `start-pre`, where it waits in this lock itself, and `exited`, where its process has finished. Two waiters therefore never block each other."
