# محجوبة تماماً، حتى عندما تتجمع الرمل. حلقات قذيفة الخواص
# (`for`/`while`/`until`)عبر الحدود `git -C *`..
# force-push/reset/clean/amend.. `rm -rf*`.. `sudo*`, امتياز `gh` الأفعال
# (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow
# enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`)والتحول
# `gh api` الأفعال (`DELETE`/`PUT`.. secrets/keys/collaborators/merge الطرق).
# lost=['force-push/reset/clean/amend']
# gained=['force-push/reset/clean/amend..']
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr ""

