msgid "Baserow’s web frontend sends every API call to its one ``PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL`` and marks its ``jwt_token`` cookie ``Secure`` from its one public URL, so a session cannot live on the onion sibling. ``meta/networks.yml`` therefore opts into ``reachability.handover``: the onion vhost in `proxy.conf.j2 <templates/proxy.conf.j2>`__ answers ``/`` with a redirect to the same path on the canonical clearnet URL."
