msgid "Disk floor: the caps fit the machine only when `free + used - sum(caps) >= floor`. With the 2026-11-05 numbers and the build cache cap that is at least 54 + 107 - 120 = 41 GB against a floor of 15 GB. The floor is `INFINITO_CACHE_DISK_FLOOR` (new, default `15g`, the stop threshold of the operator's admission tool). `make cache-evict` checks it in Phase 1 and `make infra-up` refuses on a violation from Phase 5 (D11). `make cache-status` prints one JSON object per cache (path, used, cap, headroom, eviction fallback), so the admission tool, which lives in the skills repository, can count the remaining cache growth."
