msgid "LiteLLM 1.77.7 resolves the provider before translating Messages requests and again before making the completion. Its provider resolver strips a matching prefix on each pass, so ``openrouter/openrouter/free`` loses part of the upstream model ID. Using the OpenAI transport preserves ``openrouter/free`` across both passes. ``provider: openrouter`` still selects ``OPENROUTER_API_KEY``, and the explicit endpoint sends the request to OpenRouter. The provider validation uses the same endpoint as the rendered route. The client-facing alias is unchanged."
msgstr ""

