# الثانية تتخطى بصمت أي 2FA Keycloak ويمكن لأي شخص يحمل كلمة السر في الرابطة
# أن يصل إلى التطبيق حتى عندما يكون مطلوباً من شركة ويب آوثن/تو ب. Friendica's
# stock `saml` إضافة (بالفعل على قرص تحت `/var/www/html/addon/saml/`) دعم حركة
# تحرير السودان2 AuthnRequest , IdP-initiated SSO with auto-account-creation,
# which collapses the chain to a single 2رحلة ذهابا وإيابا.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The double-login is UX-hostile (creds typed twice) and the second hop silently bypasses any 2FA Keycloak enforced on the first hop — anyone with the LDAP password can reach the app even when WebAuthn/OTP is required at the IdP. Friendica's stock `saml` addon (already on disk under `/var/www/html/addon/saml/`) supports a SAML2 AuthnRequest → IdP-initiated SSO with auto-account-creation, which collapses the chain to a single 2FA-gated round-trip."
msgstr ""

msgid "The drift report fails closed: it shows old and new values only for a field that declares a type from ``SHOWN_TYPES``, whose source lies outside ``users`` and the credentials, has no segment matching ``SECRET_SEGMENT`` or naming a declared credential, resolves in the unrendered application to a plain scalar with no template, and whose values are plain scalars that hold no URL userinfo and neither equal nor contain a secret of ``secret_values``. Every other change reads ``changed`` without either value. No finding, error or line repeats a source that did not resolve. Every forms string must hold no template, since the forms are never rendered."
