msgid "The unified mode writes ``~/.claude/settings.json``, the editor’s default settings and the named Claude profile from the inventory. ``services.code.settings`` owns the general editor settings, including ``window.autoDetectColorScheme`` and the preferred light/dark themes. ``unified.settings`` owns other Claude settings; ``env``, ``model``, ``modelPicker``, and ``apiKeyHelper`` are reserved for the connection switch. Manual settings in these managed files are replaced without backups. Saved OAuth credentials, sessions, memories, and other user data are not settings and are retained. Retired profiles disappear from the profile registry, and their workspace associations move to the unified profile. The built-in Code Default profile remains available."
