msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, and ``configuration-as-code`` plugins plus every plugin its enabled addons declare, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the `ldap`, `role-strategy`, and `configuration-as-code` plugins plus every plugin its enabled addons declare, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or `svc-db-openldap` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via `JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr ""

# Joomla الصورة التي تخبز في كومبوسر من أجل التمديدات الجارية تدير Joomla
# نقابة المحامين مع قاعدة بيانات الدور وتركيبها `plg_system_keycloak` لذا
# الموقع يَتكلّمُ OIDC ضدّ Keycloak (ب) مع مسح مجموعة الـ (روباك Amel-deploy
# variant channels the role to LDAP via Joomla"العمل الأساسي لـ "دبليوجين
# بدلاً من ذلك.
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role's database, and installs the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla's core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr ""

# Joomla الصورة التي تخبز في كومبوسر من أجل التمديدات الجارية تدير Joomla CLI
# installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role
# ``plg_system_keycloak`` لذا الموقع يَتكلّمُ OIDC ضدّ Keycloak (ب) مع مسح
# مجموعة الـ (روباك Amel-deploy variant channels the role to LDAP via
# Joomlaوبدلاً من ذلك، فإن " صمامات التوثيق " الأساسية للرابطة.
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla’s core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project's standard `sys-stk-front-proxy` and `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream `kix-on-premise` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. The backend initialises its schema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) against the central `svc-db-postgres` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with `pg_trgm` pre-activated via `services.postgres.extensions`; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). The local `admin` account is seeded via `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` on first start (see `meta/secrets.yml`) and realigned with the declared credential on every later deploy by `tasks/01_admin.yml`, which runs `files/perl/realign_admin_password.pl` inside the backend."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project’s standard ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` and ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream ``kix-on-premise`` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. The backend initialises its schema (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) against the central ``svc-db-postgres`` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with ``pg_trgm`` pre-activated via ``services.postgres.extensions``; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). The local ``admin`` account is seeded via ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` on first start (see ``meta/secrets.yml``) and realigned with the declared credential on every later deploy by ``tasks/01_admin.yml``, which runs ``files/perl/realign_admin_password.pl`` inside the backend."
msgstr ""

# PostgreSQL قاعدة بيانات وعملية تمكينية وراء وكيل عكسي مثل NGINX. It manages
# container orchestration and formation via Docker Compose ونماذج متغيرة
# للبيئة، تضمن حلاً مأموناً وقابلاً للتقسيم لإدارة الهوية.
msgid "This role deploys Keycloak in a Docker environment, integrating it with a PostgreSQL database and enabling operation behind a reverse proxy such as NGINX. It manages container orchestration and configuration via Docker Compose and environment variable templates, ensuring a secure and scalable identity management solution."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
# integrates it with an NGINX reverse proxy to provide secure access. It
# leverages environment changing templates to configure LDAP connection
# settings and administrative accreditation, ensuring a smooth and
# customizable installation of LDAP account Manager.
msgid "This role deploys LAM in a Docker environment and integrates it with an NGINX reverse proxy to provide secure access. It leverages environment variable templates to configure LDAP connection settings and administrative credentials, ensuring a smooth and customizable installation of LDAP Account Manager."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LM Studio as a headless model server in a single container, in both Docker Compose and Docker Swarm deployments. The server listens on port 1234 on the internal container network and is not published through the reverse proxy, while downloaded models and server settings persist in a dedicated volume. The role downloads its declared models at deploy time and the LiteLLM Gateway publishes them under the same aliases Ollama uses, so a consumer asks for one model name and reaches whichever backend the deployment provides."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور LM Studio كخادم عاري الرأس في حاوية واحدة Docker Compose و Docker Swarm النشرات الخادم يستمع إلى الميناء 1234 على شبكة الحاويات الداخلية، ولا تنشر عن طريق الوكيل العكسي، في حين أن النماذج المحمّلة وأوساط الخواديم ما زالت موجودة في مجلد مخصص. دور تنزيل نماذجها المعلنة في وقت النشر LiteLLM Gateway تنشرها تحت نفس الأسماء المستعارة Ollama الاستخدامات، لذلك يطلب المستهلك اسماً نموذجياً واحداً ويصل إلى أيهما يدعم النشر الذي يوفره."

# و قابل للتكسير لاحتياجات إدارة الرسائل الإخبارية دعم بنية ليستمونك
# PostgreSQL قاعدة البيانات والإدماج مع وكالة إن جي إن إكس العكسية لتأمين
# الوصول إليها. لضبط وإدارة حالتك، استخدام ملفات التشكيل المقدّمة:
msgid "This role deploys Listmonk using Docker, ensuring a robust and scalable setup for your newsletter management needs. Listmonk’s architecture supports a dedicated PostgreSQL database and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure access. To configure and manage your instance, use the provided configuration files:"
msgstr ""

# in Compose and Swarm deployments, backed by the central PostgreSQL خدمة The
# gateway is headless: it binds its HTTP port on the container host and claims
# no domain of its own, and the browsing surface is published separately by
# the LiteLLM Admin UIوهو يجعل القائمة النموذجية من المساندة المحلية القابلة
# للتبادل متاحة على الجهة المضيفة، Ollama و LM Studioوأضيفت إلى الإفتتاحية
# (الإنثروبيك) و (أونتر) API المفتاح مصمم بمجرد أن ترتفع البوابة، فإنها توفر
# مفتاحاً افتراضياً واحداً لكل طلب مستهلك عبر البوابة API.
msgid "This role deploys LiteLLM as a shared gateway container in Compose and Swarm deployments, backed by the central PostgreSQL service. The gateway is headless: it binds its HTTP port on the container host and claims no domain of its own, and the browser-facing surface is published separately by the LiteLLM Admin UI. It renders the model list from the interchangeable local backends available on the host, Ollama and LM Studio, and adds the OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter entries whose API key is configured. Once the gateway is up, it provisions one virtual key per consuming application through the gateway admin API."
msgstr ""

# التواصل الاجتماعي المميزة بالكامل. Mastodon is built to support federation
# across multiple instances, offering robust content moderation, realtime
# updates, and flexible API التكامل ويشتمل هيكلها المتقدم على خدمات منفصلة
# للمقدمة على شبكة الإنترنت، متدفقة API(ب) تجهيز الوظائف الأساسية، وضمان
# الأداء العالي والقدرة على التصعيد للمجتمعات المحلية الكبيرة.
msgid "This role deploys Mastodon using Docker, streamlining the installation and configuration of a full-featured social networking platform. Mastodon is built to support federation across multiple instances, offering robust content moderation, real-time updates, and flexible API integrations. Its advanced architecture includes separate services for the web frontend, streaming API, and background job processing, ensuring high performance and scalability for large communities."
msgstr ""

# تحليلك إلى جانب قاعدة بياناته الأساسية With support for health checks,
# persistent storage for formation and data, and integration with an NGINX
# reverse proxy, Matomo تم تشكيله لتوفير تحليلات موثوق بها و قابلة للتصعيد
# لتواجدك الرقمي.
msgid "This role deploys Matomo using Docker, automating the setup of your analytics platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for configuration and data, and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Matomo is configured to provide reliable and scalable analytics for your digital presence."
msgstr ""

# تركيبة ويكي كمثال إلى جانب أساسه MariaDB قاعدة البيانات يتعامل مع توليد ملف
# التكوين الأساسي (LocalSettings.php) مِنْ a نموذج بذرّة ويُدمجُ مع a NGINX
# proxy العكسي لa secure, efficient web access.
msgid "This role deploys MediaWiki using Docker, automating the setup of your wiki instance along with its underlying MariaDB database. It handles generating the essential configuration file (LocalSettings.php) from a seeded template and integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure, efficient web access."
msgstr ""

# إدارة الأحداث إلى جانب قاعدة بياناته الأساسية بدعم عمليات الفحص الصحي،
# والتخزين المستمر للشحنات والتشكيلات، والإدماج بلا هوادة مع عميلة من طراز
# NGINX العكسية، Mobilizon يتم تشكيله لتوفير استضافة مناسبة موثوق بها وقابلة
# للقياس لمجتمعكم.
msgid "This role deploys Mobilizon using Docker, automating the setup of your event management platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for uploads and configuration, and seamless integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Mobilizon is configured to provide reliable and scalable event hosting for your community."
msgstr ""

# Moodle التطبيق وأساسه MariaDB قاعدة البيانات It integrates with an NGINX
# reverse proxy to ensure secure and efficient web access and uses persistent
# storage to safeguard your data and formation.
msgid "This role deploys Moodle using Docker, automating the setup of both the Moodle application and its underlying MariaDB database. It integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy to ensure secure and efficient web access and uses persistent storage to safeguard your data and configuration."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Ollama as a local model server using Docker Compose. It integrates with Open WebUI for chat and Flowise for AI workflow automation, and configures local model caching so models can be reused across sessions or run fully offline."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور Ollama كخادم نموذجي محلي Docker Composeوهو يدمج مع Open WebUI للدردشة Flowise وبالنسبة للتشغيل الآلي لتدفقات العمل في منظمة العفو الدولية، وتهيئ الملاعق المحلية للنموذج بحيث يمكن إعادة استخدام النماذج عبر الدورات أو تشغيلها بشكل غير مباشر."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at ``openbao.<domain>``, behind the platform’s HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao’s own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور OpenBao مثل Infinito.Nexus الطلب في ``openbao.<domain>``, خلف الوكيل العكسي لبرنامج HTTPS. البشر يوقعون خلال Keycloak With OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. الدولة تعيش OpenBaoومخزن الطوفان الخاص به على مجلد ثابت، ومحل للاختتام الساكنة يتكون من عقدة واحدة على كل إعادة تشغيل بحيث لا يتعين على أي مشغل أن يتدخل بعد نقله."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at `openbao.<domain>`, behind the platform's HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao's own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور OpenBao مثل Infinito.Nexus الطلب في `openbao.<domain>`, خلف المنصّةِ HTTPS الوكيل العكسي. البشر يوقعون خلال Keycloak With OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. الدولة تعيش OpenBaoمخزن العجلات الخاص على مجلد ثابت، والاختتام الثابتة الوحدوي عقد على كل إعادة تشغيل حتى لا يتدخل أي مشغل بعد نقل."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenClaw as a gateway container behind the reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Its compose service is pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host, its gateway configuration file is rendered from the role, and its state directory is kept in a persistent volume. Access is fronted by an OAuth2 proxy with Keycloak sign-in when Keycloak is part of the deployment."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور OpenClaw كحاوية بوابة خلف الوكيل العكسي على نطاقها الكانوني خدماته المجهزة مثبتة في وقت العزل الذي Kata & gVisor ويجري اختيار الدور الذي يقوم به البلد المضيف، ويصدر ملف تشكيلة البوابة من الدور، ويحتفظ بدليل الدولة في حجم مستمر. الوصول مقدم من OAuth2 محترف مع Keycloak التوقيع عندما Keycloak جزء من النشر."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central ``svc-db-openldap`` directory, and runs side by side with ``web-app-nextcloud`` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور OpenCloud استخدام Docker Compose In single-binary mode and exposes it under ``open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` من خلال الوكيل العكسي المركزي يُسجّلُ نشرَ إلى المشتركِ Keycloak عالم عن طريق منظمة التعاون والتنمية في الميدان الاقتصادي، ومستعملو المصادر والمجموعات من المركز ``svc-db-openldap`` دليل، ويركض جنبا إلى جنب مع ``web-app-nextcloud`` لذا يمكن لكل منابر الملفات أن تتعايش مع نفس المضيف للتفاصيل المتعلقة بأسلاك الهوية `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ و `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenCloud using Docker Compose in single-binary mode and exposes it under `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` through the central reverse proxy. It wires the deployment to the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC, sources users and groups from the central `svc-db-openldap` directory, and runs side by side with `web-app-nextcloud` so both file platforms can coexist on the same host. For identity wiring details see [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) and [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور OpenCloud استخدام Docker Compose In single-binary mode and exposes it under `open.cloud.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` من خلال الوكيل العكسي المركزي يُسجّلُ نشرَ إلى المشتركِ Keycloak عالم عن طريق منظمة التعاون والتنمية في الميدان الاقتصادي، ومستعملو المصادر والمجموعات من المركز `svc-db-openldap` دليل، ويركض جنبا إلى جنب مع `web-app-nextcloud` لذا يمكن لكل منابر الملفات أن تتعايش مع نفس المضيف للتفاصيل المتعلقة بأسلاك الهوية [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) و [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Pi-hole as a containerized service within the Infinito.Nexus platform. Access is protected by OAuth2/Keycloak SSO, with RBAC enforced via OpenLDAP group membership."
msgstr "This role deploys Pi-hole as a containerized service within the Infinito.Nexus منصة الوصول محمية من قبل OAuth2/Keycloak SSO, with RBAC enforced via OpenLDAP العضوية الجماعية."

# والتشكيل والإدارة Pretix خادم إنه يدمج مع الخارج PostgreSQL قاعدة البيانات
# Redis للكاميرات والجلسات، ووكالة إن جي إن إكس العكسية. The role supports
# advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo التحليلات، وتوثيق
# مكتب التعاون الدولي، والقطع المركزي، مما يجعله حلاً قوياً وملائماً في إطار
# Infinito.Nexus النظام الإيكولوجي.
msgid "This role deploys Pretix using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your Pretix server. It integrates with an external PostgreSQL database, Redis for caching and sessions, and an NGINX reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr ""

# المستخدمة Docker Composeإنه يكشف Prometheus الموقع الشبكي UI
# ``prometheus.<domain>`` ويحميها مع SSO عبر Keycloak بإستخدام (أوث)2-بروكسي)
# ) ويُدمج تعميم الوصول في نهاية الدورة.
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at ``prometheus.<domain>`` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr ""

# المستخدمة Docker Composeإنه يكشف Prometheus الموقع الشبكي UI
# `prometheus.<domain>` ويحميها مع SSO عبر Keycloak بإستخدام (أوث)2-بروكسي) )
# ويُدمج تعميم الوصول في نهاية الدورة.
msgid "This role deploys Prometheus as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using Docker Compose. It exposes the Prometheus web UI at `prometheus.<domain>` and protects it with SSO via Keycloak using oauth2-proxy. Universal logout is integrated for session termination."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys SeaweedFS as the central provider of the project-wide object-store service (engine ``seaweedfs``). Web-app roles consume it like a database: they enable a ``seaweedfs`` service in their ``meta/services.yml`` and resolve host, port, bucket, and credentials through the ``objstore`` lookup. A single server container runs master, volume, filer, and the S3 gateway in one process. The role serves one canonical domain:"
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys SeaweedFS as the central provider of the project-wide object-store service (engine `seaweedfs`). Web-app roles consume it like a database: they enable a `seaweedfs` service in their `meta/services.yml` and resolve host, port, bucket, and credentials through the `objstore` lookup. A single server container runs master, volume, filer, and the S3 gateway in one process. The role serves one canonical domain:"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Svc Engine."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور Svc Engine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Svc Objstore."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور Svc Objstore."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Test E2E Cli."
msgstr "نشر هذا الدور Test E2E Cli."

# والتشكيل والإدارة XWiki خادم وهو يدمج مع قاعدة بيانات ذات صلة ووكيل عكسي.
# The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo
# التحليلات، وتوثيق مكتب التعاون الدولي، والقطع المركزي، مما يجعله حلاً قوياً
# وملائماً في إطار Infinito.Nexus النظام الإيكولوجي.
msgid "This role deploys XWiki using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your XWiki server. It integrates with an relational database and a reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys Zammad as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``ghcr.io/zammad/zammad`` image (Rails app, WebSocket, scheduler, nginx, plus a one-shot init container that bypasses the setup wizard via ``auto_wizard.json``). Search is provided by a bundled Elasticsearch container; PostgreSQL, Redis and Memcached are consumed from the central ``svc-db-*`` providers via ``sys-stk-full``. Authentication uses direct OpenID Connect against the shared Keycloak client; LDAP federation and SMTP/IMAP via the mail server (`web-app-email <../web-app-email/>`__) are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys Zammad as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream `ghcr.io/zammad/zammad` image (Rails app, WebSocket, scheduler, nginx, plus a one-shot init container that bypasses the setup wizard via `auto_wizard.json`). Search is provided by a bundled Elasticsearch container; PostgreSQL, Redis and Memcached are consumed from the central `svc-db-*` providers via `sys-stk-full`. Authentication uses direct OpenID Connect against the shared Keycloak client; LDAP federation and SMTP/IMAP via the mail server ([web-app-email](../web-app-email/)) are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a Matrix homeserver and the Element web client. Two deployment flavors are supported, selected via ``services.matrix.flavor``:"
msgstr "This role deploys a Matrix خادم المنزل وزبون الإنترنت تم دعم نكهتين للنشر يتم اختيارهما عبر ``services.matrix.flavor``:"

