# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "This role is a general GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3- قائمة الطلاب (``action``.. ``uuid``.. ``url``) مستهلك من قبل ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. وهي لا تشحن أي تمديد محدد لها ولا تقرأ ``meta/addons/`` الملفات الأدوار التي تقوم بها السفن لتوسيع نطاقات الشبكة، مثل `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, إعلانها من خلال عقد الإضافات الموحد بموجب ``meta/addons/`` (الاحتياجات 026)مع ملف واحد لكل تمديد (``mechanism: extension``.. ``source: upstream``.. ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."

