msgid "`Proxmox VE <https://www.proxmox.com/en/products/proxmox-virtual-environment/overview>`__ is an open-source virtualization platform built on Debian. It runs QEMU/KVM virtual machines, manages their storage, networks and resource pools, and serves a web UI and a REST API with fine-grained, pool-scoped permissions and API tokens."
