msgid "`native` is the local email and password sign-in Greenlight offers whenever `OPENID_CONNECT_ISSUER` is unset. Greenlight has no switch of its own for it, so [tasks/04_login_methods.yml](./tasks/04_login_methods.yml) refuses an inventory that sets `native` equal to `sso`."
